    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. It sounds like you're saying there's really no legitimate debate left on this if the scientific community has already decided those other views are just \"incorrect.\" Don't you think it's a bit dismissive to label those arguments as wrong instead of exploring the different frameworks they're using? It feels like the \"consensus\" is being used to shut down any conversation that doesn't follow the specific sociological view you just described.",
